OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA fine
OL,6,Fevening with showers easing. Cloud
OL,7,Fthickens and lowers from the west with
OL,8,Foutbreaks of patchy rain initially,
OL,9,Fturning heavy by dawn. Turning breezy
OL,10,Fand remaining mild.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FEarly cloud and rain clear
OL,13,Fto the southeast with a mostly dry day
OL,14,Fwith plenty of sunny spells then
OL,15,Ffollowing. The odd shower possible
OL,16,Ftowards the northwest.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
